<span style="font-weight: 400;">Dias 25 e 26 de maio</span>

<span style="font-weight: 400;">Local: Miramar Regional Park - Amphitheater.</span>

<span style="font-weight: 400;">16801 Miramar Pkwy, Miramar, FL 33027</span>

